  "scope": "HN Algolia index snapshot; exact alias mention in title, URL or story body, deduplicated by story ID. Comments are timestamped replies within each cohort window on those stories; they need not mention the model. No comment text or account identifiers published. Not the full web, sentiment, unique demand or paid adoption.",
  "selection": "Illustrative six-model comparison: original Jev/Qwen3/GPT-OSS cohorts retained unchanged; user-requested DeepSeek-R1, GPT-6 Astra and Claude Opus 5 added with versions/windows fixed before collecting aligned results. Open- and closed-weight generative models are included, not a representative or randomized sample of all launches.",
  "alias_rule": "Case-insensitive local regex after normalizing Unicode hyphens; Algolia prefix expansion and typo tolerance disabled. No relevance/positive-sentiment filter. Reposts remain separate submissions.",
  "retrieval": "Recursive time-slice split whenever nbHits exceeds returned hits; require exhaustive counts; merge by item ID. All six windows use UTC date of launch, not exact announcement hour. Historical index deletion/ranking/title edits and year/platform growth are uncontrolled.",
