  "interpretation": "Jev submissions grow later in this observed window; comments show launch and later peaks, not monotonic growth. GPT-6 Astra, Claude Opus 5, DeepSeek-R1 and GPT-OSS all have more total in-window comments than Jev. DeepSeek-R1 also has strong later-window activity, so renewed discussion is not unique to structured decision models. Submissions, comments and Gateway trial adoption are different measures; none establishes sentiment, retained demand, willingness to pay or causal category superiority."
